{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51431","headline":"松江 · 赵嘏","name":"松江","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"松江菰叶正芳繁，张翰逢秋忆故园。\n千里帆遮馆娃寺，一川风暖采香村。\n潮声渐遇仙人宅，鹤市曾迷子夜魂。\n我有五湖烟艇在，不堪残日动征鞍。\n（《百城烟水》四《吴江》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51431.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51431","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}